277|      <div class="wrap footer-grid">
278|        <div><img src="/images/logo-white.svg" alt="Markethink" /><p>Markethink is an AI marketing system managed by expert marketers. It learns your business, runs marketing day to day, and connects campaigns to leads and follow-up.</p><strong>Your marketing operation, powered by AI and managed by experts.</strong></div>
279|        <nav aria-label="Footer navigation"><a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a><a href="#real-work">Real work</a><a href="/blog/">Insights</a><a href="#spanish" id="spanish">ES</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="mailto:hello@markethink.ai">hello@markethink.ai</a></nav>
280|      </div>
281|    </footer>
